    "description": "Targeted local-dev collection for video-generation-service (localhost:8180) and post-production-service (localhost:8181). Assumes scripts/local-dev/port-forward-cluster.sh is running and both services are up in IntelliJ. Set {{jwt}}, {{tenantId}}, {{projectId}}, {{shotId}}, {{shotRef}} before running -- the requests that create IDs (generate, dub) auto-populate {{jobId}} / {{voiceProfileId}} / {{renderId}} into collection variables via their test scripts.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
